<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-PaineWebber starts real estate cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-PaineWebber starts real estate cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said real estate analysts Jonathan Litt and Susan Kaupie started coverage of the real estate industry on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- They started Sun Communities Inc, Chateau Communities Inc, and Samuel Zell's Manufactured Home Communities Inc with attractive ratings, PaineWebber said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Sun was flat at 33-9/16.  Chateau added 1/8 to 28-7/8. Manufactured Home Communities shed 1/8 to 23-3/4.</p>
</text>
